### Pending — Coverage Risk Days (horizon, filtered scope)

Nom:
Coverage Risk Days (horizon)

Module:
Personnel / Availability

Description:
Count of calendar days in the horizon where the filtered scope has zero free technicians (no one fully free that day).

Formula:
COUNT days WHERE people.length > 0 AND freeHeadcount = 0
(freeHeadcount = COUNT people with deriveCellState(cell) = 'free' for that day)

Inputs:
- Filtered person rows + day cells over [date_from, date_to]

Required fields:
- Same cell fields as Available Technicians

Displayed:
- Was: Availability page KPI strip — `availability.summary.coverageRisk` / `coverageRiskHint` — removed pending catalog placement

Status:
Planned

Derived metrics (when catalogued):
- Available technician ratio = availableTechnicians / filtered headcount
- Blocked technician ratio = blockedTechnicians / filtered headcount
- Coverage risk ratio = coverageRiskDays / horizon days

Future dashboards / reports:
- Team / entity coverage heatmaps; planning assignability warnings
- Align with workforce export `blocked_ratio` when promoting to KPI_CATALOG.md

AI opportunities:
- Predict coverage risk days from upcoming leave / training density in filtered scopes

